{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"c826925c-0ae0-4f50-85e8-837677e70190","status":"SUCCESS","response":"All bugs and invariants across the four modules have been resolved:\n\n1. **`store.py` (`TenantStore`)**:\n   - Stores rates as `Decimal` instances from `TIER_CATALOG`.\n   - `upsert_tenant`: Sets `version = 1` for new tenants and increments `version` by 1 on update while notifying registered invalidation hooks `(tenant_id, None)`.\n   - `update_tenant_tier`: Updates `tier`, `unit_rate`, and `discount_rate`, increments `version`, and triggers invalidation hooks `(tenant_id, None)`. Validates known tiers and tenant IDs.\n   - `record_usage`: Validates non-negative units and unit rates, records the usage line, increments `version`, and notifies hooks `(tenant_id, period)`.\n   - `get_tenant` and `get_snapshot`: Return defensive deep copies to prevent state mutation.\n\n2. **`cache.py` (`InvoiceCache`)**:\n   - Tracks cached invoices alongside `resolved_version`.\n   - `get`: Validates matching `version` when supplied and returns deep copies.\n   - `set`: Stores deep copies associated with `(tenant_id, period)`.\n   - `invalidate`: Clears the specified period when `period` is given, or all cached periods for `tenant_id` when `period is None`, returning the count of removed entries.\n   - `clear`: Empties all cached entries.\n\n3. **`billing.py` (`calculate_invoice`)**:\n   - Implements monetary arithmetic using `Decimal` quantized to `Decimal(\"0.01\")` using `ROUND_HALF_UP`.\n   - Checks `cached_invoice` matching `(tenant_id, period, version)` and returns a defensive deep copy without reapplying discounts.\n   - Recalculates authoritatively from snapshot on cache miss or stale cache.\n\n4. **`api.py` (`BillingAPI`)**:\n   - Wires store invalidation hooks to `cache.invalidate` during initialization.\n   - `record_usage` and `change_tier_and_preview` trigger proper cache invalidations.\n   - `preview_invoice` checks and populates cache using snapshot version tags and returns defensive deep copies.\n","duration_seconds":119.7990977,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":63713,"output_tokens":10343,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":459345,"total_tokens":74056}}}
